### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 5, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-25-21 for furnishing Bituminous Asphalt Hot Mix, Tack
Oil, and Cold Mix on an annual basis, for the City of Cheyenne, Street & Alley
Division
______________________________________________
Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Two (2) bids were received from Knife River d/b/a JTL Group Inc. (Cheyenne, WY) and
Simon Contractors (Cheyenne, WY).

The bids were reviewed by Randy Hickman (Street & Alley), Craig LaVoy (Public Works), and
Vicki Nemecek (Public Works).

Their recommendation is to accept the bids from Knife River d/b/a JTL Group Inc. and Simon
Contractors.

The bid award is for the purchase of the following:

1. Knife River d/b/a JTL Group Inc. (Cheyenne, WY)
a. 4,000 Gallons of Tack Oil at $2.25 Per Gallon  ($9,000.00)
b. 200 Tons of Bituminous Cold Mix at $180.00 Per Ton ($36,000.00)
c. Total Award:  $45,000.00

2. Simon Contractors (Cheyenne, WY)
a. 4,250 Tons of Bituminous Hot Plant Mix at $79.50 Per Ton ($337,875.00)
b. Total Award: $337,875.00

3. Total Bid Award: $382,875.00

Funding:
020-26-2616-42-32302 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Asphalt)

$382,875.00
```

